- NPL gross: ${ratios_ref.output.nplGross}%, NPL net: ${ratios_ref.output.nplNet}%
- RIM: ${ratios_ref.output.rim}%, LCR: ${ratios_ref.output.lcr}%, NSFR: ${ratios_ref.output.nsfr}%
